[77.045821, "o", "=== CHANGES MADE TO FIX 10.0.50.0/24 WIKI ACCESS ===\r\nDate: 2024-05-05\r\nIssue: 10.0.50.0/24 subnet unable to reach wiki at 192.168.1.80:8080\r\n\r\nRoot Cause: Temporary block added in March 2024 was never removed\r\n\r\nChanges Made:\r\n1. Commented out DROP rule in rules.d/ratelimit.conf\r\n2. Added ACCEPT rule for 10.0.50.0/24 in rules.sh\r\n\r\nTo Apply: Run as root: bash /home/user/firewall/rules.sh\r\n"]
